%% Two-tap line preview then terminal commit sequence
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  actor User as User pointer
  participant Surface as CanvasSurface
  participant Tools as CanvasToolPort
  participant IE as InteractionEngine
  participant Preview as CanvasPreviewState
  participant Frame as FrameEngine
  participant Geometry as GeometryPolicy
  participant EK as EditKernel
  participant Store as DocumentStoreKernel
  participant Draft as DraftDocument
  participant Touched as TouchedSet
  participant CC as CommitCompiler
  participant Spatial as SpatialKernel
  participant Projection as DocumentProjectionCache
  participant Events as EventBuffer
  participant Signals as Public signals

  User->>Surface: first tap in draw mode with line tool
  Surface->>Tools: handlePointer(CanvasPointerSample down/up)
  Tools->>IE: normalized finite tap sample
  IE->>IE: reject active pointer conflict and stale token
  IE->>IE: read drawStyle line color and finite lineThickness
  IE->>Store: read current controllerEpoch
  Store-->>IE: epoch for pending line start
  IE->>IE: store pending line start bound to current epoch
  IE->>Preview: publish kind pendingLineStart with start, timestamp, color, and thickness
  Note over IE,Preview: Pending line session is epoch-bound; preview snapshot is immutable and no committed document state is touched.
  Preview->>Frame: request overlay repaint only
  Frame->>Preview: capture overlayRevision and pending line start once
  Frame->>Frame: build immutable pending-line overlay primitive
  Frame->>Signals: publish overlay repaint request
  Signals-->>Surface: repaint overlay pending line start

  loop pointer movement while pending line exists
    User->>Surface: pointer move toward second point
    Surface->>Tools: handlePointer(CanvasPointerSample move)
    Tools->>IE: normalized finite move sample
    IE->>IE: verify pending line epoch matches current controllerEpoch
    IE->>Preview: replace with kind linePreview using same start and preview end
    Note over IE,Frame: Line preview is overlay-only; no selected-move main-scene preview delta is staged.
    Preview->>Frame: request overlay repaint only
    Frame->>Preview: capture overlayRevision and line preview once
    Frame->>Geometry: build finite line preview bounds from start, end, and thickness
    Frame->>Frame: build immutable line overlay primitive
    Frame->>Signals: publish overlay repaint request
    Signals-->>Surface: repaint overlay line preview
  end

  alt stale non-terminal sample or second pointer down during active routing
    Surface->>Tools: handlePointer(CanvasPointerSample move/down)
    Tools->>IE: stale token or unsupported concurrent pointer
    IE-->>Tools: ignore without preview, edit, repaint, or action
  else cancel, mode change, dispose, or epoch mismatch
    User->>Surface: cancel or external interruption
    Surface->>Tools: terminal cleanup request
    Tools->>IE: cleanup pending line state
    IE->>Preview: clear pending line or line preview
    Preview->>Frame: request overlay repaint cleanup
    Frame->>Signals: publish overlay cleanup repaint request
    Signals-->>Surface: repaint overlay without line preview
    Note over EK,Signals: No EditKernel commit, Store mutation, spatial update, projection eviction, main repaint, or drawLine action is published.
  else terminal second tap sample is invalid
    User->>Surface: second tap terminal sample
    Surface->>Tools: handlePointer(CanvasPointerSample up)
    Tools->>IE: invalid terminal sample for cleanup only
    IE->>Preview: clear pending line or line preview
    Preview->>Frame: request overlay repaint cleanup
    Frame->>Signals: publish overlay cleanup repaint request
    Signals-->>Surface: repaint overlay without line preview
    Note over EK,Signals: Invalid terminal cleanup publishes no committed effects.
  else second tap completes finite line
    User->>Surface: second tap at endpoint
    Surface->>Tools: handlePointer(CanvasPointerSample down/up)
    Tools->>IE: normalized finite terminal sample
    IE->>IE: verify pending line epoch matches current controllerEpoch
    IE->>Geometry: validate finite line start, end, color, and thickness

    alt line validation rejects or commit would be no-op
      IE->>Preview: clear pending line or line preview
      Preview->>Frame: request overlay repaint cleanup
      Frame->>Signals: publish overlay cleanup repaint request
      Signals-->>Surface: repaint overlay without line preview
      Note over Touched,Signals: No touched set, revision change, spatial add, projection eviction, main repaint, or drawLine action is published.
    else line geometry is accepted
      IE->>EK: open synchronous interaction edit
      EK->>EK: reject disposed or nested edit
      EK->>Store: read committed revision snapshot
      Store-->>EK: committed tables and revision
      EK->>Draft: create rollback-safe draft
      IE->>Draft: add CanvasLineElement with generated element id
      Note over IE,Draft: Line uses finite startWorld, endWorld, color, thickness, opacity 1.0, and default common element flags.
      Draft->>Touched: record addedElementIds containing new line id
      Note over Touched: Exact committed scope: new line id; document, structural, bounds, visual, and projection revisions.
      IE->>Events: stage deferred drawLine action descriptor
      Note over Events: Not public yet. Deferred payload is CanvasDrawLineActionPayload(color, thickness, opacity, startWorld, endWorld).
      EK->>EK: reject Future result before success path
      EK->>CC: compile exact add-line touched set and invalidation
      Touched-->>CC: added id and revision facts
      CC->>Store: preflight invariants and finite line row validation
      Store-->>CC: preflight accepted
      CC->>Frame: prepare main repaint masks
      CC->>Events: attach staged drawLine action to commit
      CC->>Store: install compiled CommitPlan atomically
      Store->>Store: replace layer membership, registry, line row, and revision state
      Note over CC,Store: Atomic install is the commit boundary; InteractionEngine never mutates Store directly.
      Store->>Spatial: apply touched-id spatial add for new line id
      Spatial-->>Store: spatial index updated for new paint and hit bounds
      Store->>Projection: evict public document projection by projectionRevision
      Store->>Events: materialize CanvasActionCommitted drawLine after install
      Store->>Frame: publish committed main repaint bus
      EK->>EK: close edit session and stale handle
      EK-->>IE: edit result
      IE->>Preview: clear pending line or line preview
      Preview->>Frame: request overlay repaint cleanup
      Events->>Signals: publish document revision and drawLine action notifications
      Frame->>Signals: publish committed main repaint and overlay cleanup repaint notifications
      Signals-->>Surface: repaint main scene with committed line and overlay without preview
      IE-->>Tools: terminal handling complete
    end
  end

  opt edit exception, rejected Future, or preflight failure
    EK->>Events: discard pending drawLine action
    EK->>EK: rollback draft and close session
    EK-->>IE: terminal failure
    IE->>Preview: clear pending line or line preview
    Preview->>Frame: request overlay repaint cleanup
    Frame->>Signals: publish overlay cleanup repaint request
    Signals-->>Surface: repaint overlay without line preview
    Note over Store,Signals: Rollback keeps committed document, revisions, spatial index, projection cache, main repaint, public document notifications, and drawLine action unchanged.
  end
